msgstr "Sertakan fail sahaja"

msgid "Choose reports or documents"
msgstr "Pilih laporan atau dokumen"

msgid "Documents"
msgstr "Dokumen"

msgid "Add more files to the USB"
msgstr "Tambah lagi fail ke USB"

msgid "Copied {n} file(s) to the USB."
msgstr "{n} fail disalin ke USB."

msgid ""
"To embed reports into the DICOM archive for a PACS, add them before "
"building."
msgstr ""
"Untuk membenamkan laporan ke dalam arkib DICOM bagi PACS, tambahkannya "
"sebelum membina."

msgid "Found {n} report PDF(s) — review them in ‘Add documents’."
msgstr "Menjumpai {n} PDF laporan — semak di ‘Tambah dokumen’."

msgid ""
"Couldn't embed {name} into the archive — it's still included as a file."
msgstr ""
"Tidak dapat membenamkan {name} ke dalam arkib — ia tetap disertakan sebagai "
"fail."

msgid ""
"1.  Add your studies — CDs, USB folders, or ZIP downloads\n"
"2.  Review everything we found\n"
"3.  Add any report or lab PDFs (optional)\n"
"4.  Build one archive and copy it to a USB drive for your doctor"
msgstr ""
"1.  Tambah imbasan anda — CD, folder USB atau muat turun ZIP\n"
"2.  Semak semua yang kami jumpai\n"
"3.  Tambah sebarang PDF laporan atau makmal (pilihan)\n"
"4.  Bina satu arkib dan salin ke pemacu USB untuk doktor anda"
